{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02590",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.28,
      "end_seconds": 3.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Hi, sit anywhere you like."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.54,
      "end_seconds": 7.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "hi, uh, thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.44,
      "end_seconds": 12.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "What would you like to to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.69,
      "end_seconds": 20.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "text": "I wanted to to get a growing red ring on my thigh looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.7,
      "end_seconds": 24.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.1,
      "end_seconds": 40.59,
      "duration_seconds": 14.49,
      "text": "Let me think, it's been like this since Friday. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest. I've also had tiredness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.83,
      "end_seconds": 46.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "right right. What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.35,
      "end_seconds": 57.31,
      "duration_seconds": 9.96,
      "text": "I have arthritis in my knees. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.6,
      "end_seconds": 61.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.78,
      "end_seconds": 71.08,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "Uh, yes, I had a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.07,
      "end_seconds": 85.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.06,
      "end_seconds": 98.91,
      "duration_seconds": 11.85,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I hardly move around during the day. I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.82,
      "end_seconds": 112.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.71,
      "end_seconds": 126.34,
      "duration_seconds": 13.63,
      "text": "I mean, I'm on naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day for the knee pain though honestly, some days I forget to take it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.27,
      "end_seconds": 142.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "okay have you had palpitations by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.16,
      "end_seconds": 144.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "no palpitations thankfully"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.71,
      "end_seconds": 149.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Did you get facial weakness, joint swelling or stiff neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.24,
      "end_seconds": 155.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.24,
      "end_seconds": 159.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.75,
      "end_seconds": 162.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "no, joints are fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.89,
      "end_seconds": 168.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "anything with your heart like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.03,
      "end_seconds": 174.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Okay, so no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 175.1,
      "end_seconds": 182.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. BP is 111 over 82, respiratory rate 15, pulse 73."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.6,
      "end_seconds": 187.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.54,
      "end_seconds": 193.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "now I'm going to do a short physical check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.98,
      "end_seconds": 196.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "yeah, no problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.24,
      "end_seconds": 201.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "I'll listen to to your chest now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.63,
      "end_seconds": 222.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "there is an expanding ring-shaped red patch, about eight centimetres across, on the thigh"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.05,
      "end_seconds": 225.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "yeah, um, no problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.51,
      "end_seconds": 243.59,
      "duration_seconds": 12.08,
      "text": "okay all finished thank you. Let me tell you where I've got to. My working impression is early Lyme disease. I can't rule out cellulitis yet"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.77,
      "end_seconds": 249.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Let me think, is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.59,
      "end_seconds": 275.31,
      "duration_seconds": 20.72,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's early Lyme disease, and we'll watch how it goes. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had a growing red ring on your thigh, since Friday, and no stiff neck or joint swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.94,
      "end_seconds": 280.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "That's it it um yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.17,
      "end_seconds": 310.11,
      "duration_seconds": 27.94,
      "text": "The treatment will be doxycycline, 100 milligrams, twice a day, twenty-one days. It's for early Lyme disease. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Take the doxycycline with food and avoid strong sun. We'll catch up in three weeks. Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.84,
      "end_seconds": 321.48,
      "duration_seconds": 10.64,
      "text": "so I take the doxycycline 100 milligrams twice a day and come back in three weeks is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.38,
      "end_seconds": 326.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "yes, exactly right have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.1,
      "end_seconds": 332.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "well uh good thanks I'll see you then"
    }
  ]
}